        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>The Game Series - Wasteland Horror Radio:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to WHR Sixty-Six Point, Uh.. Seven!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wasteland Horror Radio is an episodic horror game series by HsRetroGames made with Unreal Engine. Each game is a new episode, a new short and sweet creepy tale or story of horror..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814590/extras/f55d3f460fd83569f9e99f2215a7769f.avif?t=1787925882\" width=1457 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our near post apocalyptic future, an old scorched ghoul finds a bizarre shack in the wasteland containing a bunch of vintage radio equipment and a trunk full of old books and tales of horror.. Tonight at sunset, he begins his broadcast of obscure horror stories and creepy tales from the past..</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Pilot Episode 1 - The Radio:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814590/extras/7c12acb7cbc287b290a3ef7162beec13.avif?t=1787925882\" width=1410 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gift, a vintage radio, given to him by his would-be adopted father. A radio of revelations bound only to him, repeatedly showing him all the people he brutally murdered on the night of September 20th, 1991..</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>More About This Episode:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our protagonist (Robbie), seemingly wakes in a desert compound built by his adopted father. With no memory, rotting and no longer able to speak, he heads towards an old abandoned biker saloon with the sound of a bizarre radio broadcast playing in the distance.. As he finds more radios, things environmentally change as he is forced to remember what he has done and must realize he is no longer in the world of the living - Perhaps his own Hell..</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Episode Length:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through time for this episode is 30-60+ minutes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Headset Recommended!:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using a headset or earphones is recommended for a more immersive sound experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Photo Sensitive Warning:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be advised that this game may contain flashing lights or effects that may be harmful to those who experience photo sensitivity or seizures induced by certain visual or video content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
